<title>USA: Most IMM currencies end near lower end of ranges.</title>
<headline>Most IMM currencies end near lower end of ranges.</headline>
<text>
<p>Nov 12 - Most IMM currency futures ended near the lower end of their recent ranges, as dollar-friendly comments and lifted the U.S. currency. Funds were active sellers in the pits, pushing Dec marks through support to $0.6637, or about 1.5090 spot. Dec yen fell, but remained above Monday's overall low of $0.008973.</p>
<p>-Derivatives Desk(312)408-8750/E-mail:derivatives@reuters.com</p>
